  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutants-and-zombies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1204883?logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=black&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=orange&amp;color=242424\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmutants-and-zombies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mutants-and-zombies?style=flat&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=black&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=18ED49&amp;color=242424\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載數\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutants-and-zombies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1204883(4F21AC).svg\" alt=\"支援版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rSVp3nCpPx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1388544059114786907?style=flat&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=blue\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D71EVQVC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-75D5E3?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"靜態徽章\"></a></p><p>此模組為遊戲新增了多種突變體與殭屍生物。它是「Ryan's Zombies」模組的官方重鑄版。所有模型均由使用者「Nice_Try_Boi」創作並提供。</p><p>目前已開放下列生物：</p><ul>\n<li><strong>殭屍蠻兵</strong> - 體型巨大且非常強壯的坦克型殭屍（ID：<code>mutantszombies:zombie_brute</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>爬行者</strong> - 體型小、速度快，具備攀爬能力（ID：<code>mutantszombies:crawler</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>噴吐者</strong> - 會發射史萊姆球（ID：<code>mutantszombies:spitter</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>水泡殭屍</strong> - 更快速、更強壯的殭屍（ID：<code>mutantszombies:blister_zombie</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>裂頭殭屍</strong> - 更快速、更強壯的殭屍（ID：<code>mutantszombies:split_head_zombie</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>突變蠻兵</strong> - 體型巨大且非常強壯的坦克型突變體（ID：<code>mutantszombies:mutant_brute</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>腐敗突變體</strong> - 比殭屍更高大、更強壯但更緩慢（ID：<code>mutantszombies:rotten_mutant</code>）</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>設定</strong></h3><hr><p>此模組提供簡易設定，可啟用/停用自然生成。</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Forge</span></em></span> - 設定檔儲存於每個世界：<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <em>minecraft/saves/[你的世界名稱]/serverconfig/mutantszombies-server.toml</em></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">NeoForge</span></em></span> - 設定檔儲存於每個 Minecraft 安裝目錄/實例：<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <em>minecraft/config/mutantszombies-server.toml</em></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Fabric</span></em></span> - 設定檔儲存於每個 Minecraft 安裝目錄/實例：<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <em>minecraft/config/mutantszombies.json5</em></li>\n</ul>",
